<https://loze-ontology.org/isThemeIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://loze-ontology.org/Eventuality> .
<https://loze-ontology.org/isContentIn> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The relation that obtains between a particular p and an eventuality e if and only p is enclosed or contained by some other particular in the context of e" .
<https://loze-ontology.org/isThemeIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://loze-ontology.org/Particular> .
<https://loze-ontology.org/isHostIn> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "This relation does not apply to a person who is 'hosting' a party or to the 'host' of a game - who are rather agents in the respective eventualities" .
