<https://loze-ontology.org/ConcreteParticular> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A particular that is bounded to one spatial location at a time" .
<https://loze-ontology.org/isOriginIn> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "The starting point in a journey, the supply point in a utility supply, the seller in a property conveyance, the seed in a plant growth" .
<https://loze-ontology.org/isThemeIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://loze-ontology.org/isParticipantIn> .
