<https://loze-ontology.org/isConcretizationOf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://loze-ontology.org/hasParticipant> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The relation that obtains between an eventuality e' and an entity e if and only if e is a participant in e'" .
<https://loze-ontology.org/isComponentIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://loze-ontology.org/Particular> .
<https://loze-ontology.org/Object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://loze-ontology.org/Thing> .
