<https://loze-ontology.org/isSettingIn> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Only objects can be settings, since they are the only particulars that have the sort of hierarchical structure in which something can occupy a role or function" .
<https://loze-ontology.org/Place> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A room, the interior of a refrigerator, a tunnel, the left ventricle of your heart" .
