<https://loze-ontology.org/isProductIn> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The relation that obtains between a particular p and an eventuality e if and only if p is brought into existence by some other particular in the context of e" .
<https://loze-ontology.org/isCauseOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://loze-ontology.org/Eventuality> .
<https://loze-ontology.org/isInstrumentIn> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The relation that obtains between a particular p and an eventuality e if and only if p enables an agent to affects some thing in the context of e" .
<https://loze-ontology.org/hasSetting> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The relation that obtains between an eventuality e and an object o if and only if o is the setting in e" .
