<https://loze-ontology.org/isHeldIn> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "The possessed thing is the held in a possession or ownership; the managed employee is the held in a management relationship" .
<https://loze-ontology.org/SchematicParticular> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "The division between concrete particulars and schematic particulars cuts across the further sub-divisions of particulars: there are concrete objects and schematic objects, concrete eventualities and schematic eventualities, concrete aggregates and schematic aggregates, and so on" .
