<https://loze-ontology.org/isConcretizationOf> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The relation that obtains between a concrete particular c and a schematic particular s if and only if (1) c exemplifies or has the main features of s, and (2) s provides the benchmark or the norm for the properties and the behaviour of c" .
