<https://loze-ontology.org/Place> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A thing that is individuated by its position relative to other things - such as being enclosed by an object, being to the left side of an object, or being immediately North of another place" .
<https://loze-ontology.org/hasHolder> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://loze-ontology.org/Entity> .
<https://loze-ontology.org/isBeneficiaryIn> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "In some cases, the beneficiary of an eventuality is the same as the patient: for example, the beneficiary of successful a medication, therapy, or surgical operation is the patient" .
