<https://loze-ontology.org/isDestinationIn> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "The arrival point in a travel, the distribution point in a utility supply, the buyer in a property conveyance" .
<https://loze-ontology.org/Particular> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Particular entities are to be contrasted with classes; the concept of a particular mostly corresponds to the Semantic Web concept of an individual or instance" .
<https://loze-ontology.org/Thing> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Despite the similar local name, this class is much narrower than owl:Thing, which encompasses all entities" .
<https://loze-ontology.org/SchematicParticular> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A document (as opposed to its particular copies), a work of music (as opposed to its performances), an alphabetic character (as opposed to its inscriptions), a software (as opposed to its installed copies), a substance or material like water or gold (as opposed to their circumscribed portions), a car model (as opposed to its units)" .
<https://loze-ontology.org/isWaypointIn> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The relation that obtains between a particular p and an eventuality e if and only if p is an intermediate point of movement or change in the context of e" .
